{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "25929da3-b62f-5335-b597-8cc0d0c70f2a", "source_ordinal": 4290, "reading_ordinal": 3789, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "对影成三人", "published_at": "2026-03-13T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1918554488874178005/answer/2035346497865258428"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "身为成绩第一的学生，连和老师的关系都处不好，这是一种惊人的社会性无能。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这种无能如果不被视为致命的问题立刻着手寻求改善，所谓“年级第一”的“成绩”只不过是比纸还薄的虚妄。", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "区区一个学校而已，又不是宇宙中心，在这螺蛳壳里、一时半会间做了个小霸王，这么点“成就”就搞到了社会性破产，这要是成就再大点，是要开始吃人吗？", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "ta这个德行，可能只是和老师关系不好吗？这要能和同学关系好才叫有鬼了。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你想想ta这逻辑——成绩好就可以不必在乎任何人，也就意味着一旦别人成绩比ta好，ta就会默认别人就获得了把ta踩在脚下的合法权利。", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "以ta这个性格，ta受得了别人以其人之道还治其人之身吗？", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "ta现在觉得老师多可悲，轮到ta时，ta就有多恐惧。", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 314}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "于是ta根本适应不了自己不是第一的剧情。", "char_start": 315, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "ta要滑到第六，按照ta自己的理论，头上就足有五个人可以把ta当狗骂，而ta没资格不受。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "那就意味着这个第一名对ta来说，是生死攸关的东西。", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 406}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "一旦遇到个有威胁的对手，ta不每天熬到半夜来确保自己“绝对领先”才有鬼。", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而“天天熬到半夜”本身就足以堆积起一次惨烈的事故——积劳成疾，大病一场，抱病硬上，大败一场是逻辑必然的结果。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 498}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你自己爱作践人，自然最怕人作践，自然要自己把自己吓得睡不安枕、食不甘味，而食少事烦是灭身之道。", "char_start": 499, "char_end": 546}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而你一旦出个事故连降几名，在这事故之后你的思想包袱会加倍的重，会更难睡着、更煎熬、更低效，再出事故的概率更大，出得更快。", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 607}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "再栽第二次跟头，那都不是跌到四五名了，怕是要跌到十几二十名了。", "char_start": 608, "char_end": 639}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你之前怎么看人是废物，现在就怎么看自己是废物。你说别人废物，别人只要看不到你，就听不到，而你自己躲得掉你自己吗？", "char_start": 640, "char_end": 696}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你一睁眼就听得见自己骂自己废物，一天二十四小时，一年三百六十五天，无处可躲。", "char_start": 697, "char_end": 735}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "现在张狂凶恶的你自己，就会掐着稍受挫折的你自己，一轮一轮的往地狱里按。", "char_start": 736, "char_end": 771}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你越是下跌，自己压着自己下坠的力就会越猛烈，你要再反弹回升的难度就越大。你自己想想这是个什么指向、什么结局？", "char_start": 772, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "看懂了这个，当爹妈的还在考虑什么“站孩子还是站老师”？", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 854}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "真“站孩子”，就必须“站老师”。", "char_start": 855, "char_end": 871}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "人要对人仁慈，第一要害处根本不在于要“讨好别人”，而是为了让自己相信“人可以对人仁慈”。", "char_start": 872, "char_end": 916}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你对人仁慈，你是人，你才能相信“人对人仁慈是可能的”。", "char_start": 917, "char_end": 944}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "发现了吗？你看到任何别的人对人仁慈，都没有这同等的证明有效性——因为那完全可能有别的原因、可能有你不知道的图谋。", "char_start": 945, "char_end": 1001}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "只有你自己，你自己清楚自己是真的仁慈，这再也做不了假，于是你才可以相信人对人可以仁慈，可以相信人大多是好人。", "char_start": 1002, "char_end": 1056}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "而这一认知首先拯救的是你自己。", "char_start": 1057, "char_end": 1072}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "同样的道理，你自己诚实，你才会相信人会诚实；你自己尊重，你才会相信人会尊重。", "char_start": 1073, "char_end": 1111}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "反过来，你自己狠毒，你必然相信别人必狠毒；你自己暴虐，你必然认定别人必暴虐。", "char_start": 1112, "char_end": 1150}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你第一个诅咒的就是将来的自己。", "char_start": 1151, "char_end": 1166}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这种必然返于自身的镜像效应，才是你必须仁慈、尊重、宽容的根本原因——因为第一个受益得救的，不是得你仁慈、尊重、宽容的ta人，而是借此可以相信ta人会对你仁慈、尊重、宽容的你自己。", "char_start": 1167, "char_end": 1256}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "哪怕将来有人对你的这份信赖有辜负，这份信赖都仍然对你是绝对必要的，因为它至少在被辜负前能让你睡得着觉，过得了日子。", "char_start": 1257, "char_end": 1314}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "将来被辜负，那至少是几年后的事。而且就算受伤，那伤也容易好。", "char_start": 1315, "char_end": 1345}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你被自己的影子吓得睡不着觉，几个月你就疯了。", "char_start": 1346, "char_end": 1368}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "看懂了这个，你还要“站孩子”吗？", "char_start": 1369, "char_end": 1385}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "别害人了。", "char_start": 1386, "char_end": 1391}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 36}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0541"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子在学校拒绝老师被针对了，刚刚叫了家长，应该站孩子还是老师？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035"], "summary": "围绕“对影成三人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“身为成绩第一的学生，连和老师的关系都处不好，这是一种惊人的社会性无能。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "身为成绩第一的学生，连和老师的关系都处不好，这是一种惊人的社会性无能。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b7095215-db9c-592e-98fc-1fbc0a72997c", "source_ordinal": 267, "reading_ordinal": 3790, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "熊猫之旅", "published_at": "2026-03-13T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/449e2096172011f1977c52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是一种病，知道吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一谈意义，就要是永被全人类铭记，最好人类灭亡后，外星人还来研究地球方言，接着传唱到宇宙尽头。", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "别想那么远，那么大。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "今天一起欢笑，今天欢笑了就是意义。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "开心了这一下的生命不比没有开心这一下的生命好吗？开心了一下没意义吗？", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "第二天想起你昨天多开心了这一下，你甚至可以再开心一下。这开心的第二下，不就是这第一下开心的意义吗？", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 171}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "又或者吃亏了、受苦了，那么记住了教训后来变聪明了、受住了痛苦后来变坚韧了，这不就是意义吗？", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 217}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "欢乐有意义，痛苦也有意义；成功有意义，失败也有意义。", "char_start": 218, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "只要有情节，就必然能找到非常具体的意义，而且是丰富的、多维的、复合的意义。", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "甚至意义本身还会再生出意义——经过时时回想、发掘，会在主干上生出新芽，向着理性的阳光舒展出无数的枝条来。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "“最后在一起”只是“相遇”后无数的情节、无数的意义以及意义再生出的意义里的一枝而已。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "甚至没在一起自有没在一起的好处。", "char_start": 379, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "仅仅因为“没在一起”就会抱怨“相遇没有意义”，这是一种何等浪费的人生啊。", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 432}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你上山就是为了看到熊猫，没看到熊猫就毫无意义了。", "char_start": 433, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我上山是为了看到熊猫，但我锻炼了身体、观看了风景、拍了照片、吸收了新鲜空气、结识了旅伴、采了蘑菇……", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我也没看到熊猫，但我可一点都不觉得“白上了一趟山”。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你干任何一件事，那件事的计划性目的就只是一个引子，是你干这事的由头。但一旦事情干起来，你的收获必须远远的超过这个引子，这理应是你生活的一个常态。", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 608}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "只有这样，你才会越活越有劲，越做越有力，而且你才会富裕起来。", "char_start": 609, "char_end": 639}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你次次来个“只要计划的目的没达到就算没意义”，那么恰恰因为一次次落空，你会不断的变得更焦虑，于是不断设定更有野心也自然更难的“意义远征”。", "char_start": 640, "char_end": 709}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "既然越来越难，你自然越来越容易一次又一次的觉得“毫无意义”。", "char_start": 710, "char_end": 740}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "最后你会把“意义”的门槛拉高到突破大气层，同时丧失一切追求意义的勇气。", "char_start": 741, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "不惊天动地的对你就都“没意义”，惊天动地的你又办不到，你要怎么活？", "char_start": 777, "char_end": 810}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你下次再把意义的门槛抬高，再看不起那些“小意义”，再来个“没看到熊猫白来了”，记得给自己两耳光。", "char_start": 811, "char_end": 859}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "世界上根本没有没意义的事，只有看不见意义的人。", "char_start": 860, "char_end": 883}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "别做这种人，这种人最没意思。", "char_start": 884, "char_end": 898}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0541"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果最后都要分离，那相遇的意义又是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“熊猫之旅”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是一种病，知道吗？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是一种病，知道吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "decc0de3-f97f-57d1-b689-c578bdea0636", "source_ordinal": 268, "reading_ordinal": 3791, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "敏感问题", "published_at": "2026-03-13T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/389e87c8165211f1933f52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "今天下午，领导突然把我叫去办公室，还让我关上门，让我坐她对面，问了我一些工作上的事情后，话锋一转，突然说：“你觉得坐你对面的小王，平时工作上表现怎样”？我觉得好难回答啊…", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "遵循以下几个原则：", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）奠定基调。", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你要说“总的来说，我觉得ta的工作表现我个人可以接受。如果存在什么我这个层面无法消化和配合的重大困难，我不会隐瞒不提。”", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 164}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这段话是一个必然设定的基准。正如这段话本身所描述的——如果你在这个时候大倒苦水，你就要面对一个指向你自己的基本问题——“早你怎么不说？”", "char_start": 165, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这么大的问题，你已经忍无可忍了，要不是我问你，看你这样子，你还会继续憋着，你什么意思？", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你是怕得罪人，宁可公司继续在茫然无知中承受损失吗？", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你既然之前没有投诉，你就已经等于用实际行动在告知上司“ta的表现，我个人没有觉得有值得上报的过失”。", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 354}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果你现在嘴上说的和你之前实际做的脱离，那么你自己首先就有职业道德问题。", "char_start": 355, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以，不论你自己有多少抱怨、腹诽，这句“我个人可以接受”都是确定的结论，没什么可纠结、犹豫的。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 439}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "2）锁定意图。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 448}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "“我整体可以接受”，意思是指对方是有一些需要我做调整才能适应的地方，只是我把做这种调整适应视为我的分内事，自己无声的就做了，因为这是对组织最好的安排，也是每个团队成员应有的自觉。否则人人遇到需要做配合的地方都视为对方的问题要求组织去处理对方，组织必然乱套。", "char_start": 449, "char_end": 577}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你现在问我意见，我就视为你打算为我移除一些适应的负担。既然是这样，我本人是觉得一切ok的，是你要认定某些地方不ok，那么自然这个我就得问你了。", "char_start": 578, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "“请问，具体哪方面需要我的反馈？能不能具体的提示我一下？”", "char_start": 650, "char_end": 679}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你这样去回答，就已经尽了对同事的爱护之义了。", "char_start": 680, "char_end": 702}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为从ta的角度来看，你先前已经作出了“可以接受”的总评价。是上司进一步指定了一个具体事项逼着你表态，你才被迫说出一些对ta不利的话的。", "char_start": 703, "char_end": 771}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "上司既然来做这个谈话，估计是掌握了什么确切的情报线索，一来是听别人的意见来确定真伪，另一方面也是在试探各个相关人是否有包庇、失察之罪。", "char_start": 772, "char_end": 839}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你直接问ta具体是什么事，上司要么回答一个具体事件，要么就会说“也就随便聊聊”。说后者这事就结束了。", "char_start": 840, "char_end": 890}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "如果是前者，是说出了什么具体的事项，例如发现经ta手的库存不匹配，要问你这个同僚知不知道。", "char_start": 891, "char_end": 936}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这意味着在你揭露之前，上司已经掌握了情况，你回不回答其实对同事已无本质影响了，同事将来知道了过程，也怪不了你什么了。", "char_start": 937, "char_end": 995}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "3）作出反馈。", "char_start": 997, "char_end": 1004}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "知道了具体事项，你可以反馈了——“关于这件事，从我的角度，希望ta的配合方式做一点这样那样的改变”。", "char_start": 1005, "char_end": 1055}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这就是你的反馈。", "char_start": 1056, "char_end": 1064}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "没有判对方有罪，只谈了“我希望有所变化的部分”。", "char_start": 1065, "char_end": 1089}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这是中性的，你永远有理由期待同事做某种变化来方便你配合，提不提在你，支持不支持在上司，接受不接受在当事人自己。上司不赞同可以否定，同事不接受可以拒绝，但这并不意味着你提都不能提。", "char_start": 1090, "char_end": 1179}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你提这种意见总是正当的。", "char_start": 1180, "char_end": 1192}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "尤其是如果你在尾巴上加上一句“也许做这样的调整对组织来说成本过高，或者对ta太过勉强，具体是否可行，还是你们再去议定”，你就更加稳妥了。", "char_start": 1193, "char_end": 1261}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "一般到这里你已经应付完了，但我们再补一点——如果上司直接要你评价此人的人品，你怎么办？", "char_start": 1263, "char_end": 1306}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "还是那句话——既然我没投诉过，就意味着对方的人品我可以接受，要说缺点，只是人无完人罢了。", "char_start": 1307, "char_end": 1351}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这就是你回答这类问题的分寸。", "char_start": 1352, "char_end": 1366}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "参考吧。", "char_start": 1367, "char_end": 1371}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 34}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0541"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：领导找你谈话，问你怎么评价某位同事，这可能关系到同事的年度调薪，我该怎么办说？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“敏感问题”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“今天下午，领导突然把我叫去办公室，还让我关上门，让我坐她对面，问了我一些工作上的事情后，话锋一转，突然说：“你觉得坐你对面的小王，平时工作上表现怎样”？我觉得好难回答啊…”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "今天下午，领导突然把我叫去办公室，还让我关上门，让我坐她对面，问了我一些工作上的事情后，话锋一转，突然说：“你觉得坐你对面的小王，平时工作上表现怎样”？我觉得好难回答啊…", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 85, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "42d508a4-ee97-5e97-8b57-86479652fb18", "source_ordinal": 263, "reading_ordinal": 3792, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "绝情谷主", "published_at": "2026-03-13T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1931882582527698404/answer/2010129489624076303"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不是绝情，而是具体的帮助需要特殊的缘分。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这里面涉及的忌讳、条件很多，越是认识清楚，就越是会知道此非正缘，爱莫能助。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "举点例子——其实人是不适合被动的接受求助请求的。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你有困苦，被我看到，你毫无“我会帮助你”的预期，甚至不知道我的存在，我主动出击，完全按照我的条款给你一份帮助，帮完即走，不留身与名，在暗中看着，看值不值得再帮，不帮我也毫无负担。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这样我就没有顾忌，常常相帮。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你有困苦，看到了我，于是走上来讨要，你唯一的努力就是讨要、唯一的资格就是困苦，我若是仅因这两条就帮了，那么你接着困苦，接着再要，何以就不再给了？", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而能满足这两条的其他人也会无限的涌来，我就算浑身是铁，能打几根钉？", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 295}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "散尽余财，最终必然还是要拒绝绝大多数，终究要留下“不仁”的判定。", "char_start": 296, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "看见没？你不知我、我才好帮；你看见我了，我们的缘分反而薄了。", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 359}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "暗中足有爱，当面却无缘。", "char_start": 360, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而这才是各种忌讳中的一种而已。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 388}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "慈善这件事做得越多，这类忌讳就知道得越多，就会显得越“绝情”。", "char_start": 389, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这其实是自然法决定的。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 432}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "其实也谈不上认知高，只不过是正常的吸取教训、总结经验的结果罢了。", "char_start": 433, "char_end": 465}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0541"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么认知高的人，别人会觉得他们很绝情？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“绝情谷主”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不是绝情，而是具体的帮助需要特殊的缘分。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不是绝情，而是具体的帮助需要特殊的缘分。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "452d88fa-a89d-5cd7-9fdc-abf8b6ff8f26", "source_ordinal": 264, "reading_ordinal": 3793, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无断点", "published_at": "2026-03-13T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1995238309396498248/answer/2009363280364319147"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "王朝反复崩溃，崩溃完了新王入主。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一看虽然天下丁口三去其一，但也还剩三之其二啊。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是巨大的劳动力，有着草原民族无法想象的生产力。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "问题是无论是齐民编户、账册契约还是钱粮税赋，全是中文写的，可没有蒙古文版本。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "蒙古文、满文、鲜卑文、突厥文，根本就没有这些州县府道、赵钱孙李、等因奉此的概念，根本没得替代。", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 152}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "敢问大王，一年数百万匹的绢，数千万贯的钱粮，要吗？", "char_start": 153, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你不用汉语的话，那你就让你手下的蒙古大臣们去当老师教孩子们学蒙语吧。ta们连蒙古文都不会写，笔都拿不住，拿什么教？教到啥时候能教会？", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你就直接和金银珠玉说再见了，一顿侵略就全白忙活了。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "要这份利益，你就要延续整个汉语行政体系，保留最起码的汉语班底，就要继续让汉人学汉语——读《论语》、读《诗经》、读《史记》来学汉语。", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "只要汉人还说汉语，用汉字，读汉史，中国的文化传承就断不了。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "历史上在军事上能击败中原王朝的敌人很多，但是其行政体系强大到能取代汉语行政体系、足以有效运作整个中华帝国的却一个都没有。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这还不算，你要享受中原的物产，不是吗？", "char_start": 430, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "那么那些好酒好茶好吃食，好景好曲好耍子，无不需要贵官先学得汉语。若是不懂汉语，不识典故，就无法真正享受到这些东西的妙处。", "char_start": 450, "char_end": 510}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "好好的大红袍，只当苦涩水；", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 524}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "千秋的古赤壁，看作乱石滩。", "char_start": 525, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "就算占了，夺了，这样不解风情，又有何享受可言呢？", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 563}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "然而享受的过程，也就是驯化的过程。", "char_start": 564, "char_end": 581}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "享受多了，蒙古人也变成汉人了。", "char_start": 582, "char_end": 597}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "能在军事上击败中原王朝的敌人多了，但在文化物质享受上超越我们，也是一个都没有。", "char_start": 598, "char_end": 637}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "所以ta们没能力造成“文明级断裂”。", "char_start": 638, "char_end": 656}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "但是，各位汉家儿郎，我们今时今日的对手可不是当年目不识丁、毫无文化建树，只有一身血勇的蛮族了。", "char_start": 657, "char_end": 704}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "我们还有一场硬仗，在座的各位皆阵列在前。", "char_start": 705, "char_end": 725}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "务要奋勇，无愧祖宗。", "char_start": 726, "char_end": 736}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0541"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么中国历史上王朝反复崩溃，却几乎从未发生“文明级断裂”？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“无断点”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“王朝反复崩溃，崩溃完了新王入主。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "王朝反复崩溃，崩溃完了新王入主。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "58db9a45-6d0b-58bf-8432-5ff5376efb3b", "source_ordinal": 265, "reading_ordinal": 3794, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "家范", "published_at": "2026-03-13T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/328727788/answer/2010713154309616186"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "一个普通人是没法成为作家和小说家的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一个作者才能成为作家和小说家。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "普通人成为作者不难。", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "人类不是碘，无法不经液相直接从固相变为气相。", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "成为作家的秘诀是成为作者。", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "成为音乐家的秘诀是成为乐手。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "成为画家的秘诀是成为画匠。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不考虑当什么作家、音乐家、画家，军事家，就是当一个写字的、打鼓的、画画的。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你就一直写字、打鼓、画画，一直搞。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 168}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "就这样。", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "然后有人跟人介绍“这是著名作家……”，你马上捂住ta嘴——“狗屁，莫听ta扯，老子就是个写字的”。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你就是作家了。", "char_start": 224, "char_end": 231}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "因为这才是能当作家的范儿。", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 245}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0541"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：一个普通人如何成为作家/小说家？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“家范”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“一个普通人是没法成为作家和小说家的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "一个普通人是没法成为作家和小说家的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "97498d05-49fb-55e0-afd7-7502d9ce8065", "source_ordinal": 266, "reading_ordinal": 3795, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "笨蛋", "published_at": "2026-03-13T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2009619799706190635/answer/2010099614590735479"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "只有聪明人才知道谁是笨蛋。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "笨蛋是不知道的。", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "能发现自己是笨蛋、笨在哪里、有多笨，这是类似“魂灵飞升到半空，用神的视角向下俯视自我”一样的神通。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "以前有个老笨蛋，到了四十岁才写下了一本说清楚自己有多笨的书。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这本书现在还在，叫《忏悔录》。", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个老笨蛋叫奥古斯丁。", "char_start": 121, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "后来另一个老笨蛋又写了一本，几乎一模一样，这本书也叫《忏悔录》。", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 165}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这个老笨蛋叫托尔斯泰。", "char_start": 166, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这两本书你都可以找来看看，撇开宗教情感的部分，你可以看看“发现自己是笨蛋”大概是一个什么概念。", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这么说吧，这在中国的传统语境里，有另一个说法，叫——", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "heading", "index": 11, "text": "大彻大悟。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 259}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "二十岁就能到，何止不晚。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 273}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d038ca3e04a63da39ad16abe9281ed16_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-d038ca3e04a63da39ad16abe9281ed16_1440w.webp?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15, "image": 2, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0541"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：二十多岁才认清自己是个笨蛋算晚吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“笨蛋”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“只有聪明人才知道谁是笨蛋。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "只有聪明人才知道谁是笨蛋。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4d19acd1-3299-5a59-9f1f-b15677a0d2d3", "source_ordinal": 262, "reading_ordinal": 3796, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "爱不受辱", "published_at": "2026-03-16T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/41c90f9618c611f19e2f52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这都是些什么鬼扯淡？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你不为别人考虑试试？", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一群同事，你不为同事考虑，你横冲直撞、唯我独尊？那是“被欺负、拿捏、受委屈”的事吗？那是大家直接请你滚蛋的事吧？", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "出门做销售，你不为客户考虑，你卖得出去？能赚到钱？那是“被欺负、拿捏、受委屈”的事吗？人家直接通知门卫别放你再进来好吗？", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "谈个恋爱，你不为对方考虑，你牵得上手？结得了缘？", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 164}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你不为人考虑，你怎么设计产品？怎么改进服务？你怎么生存？", "char_start": 165, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这是涉及生存的根本大法，岂能因为“容易被欺负”这种问题更改？", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这跟用绝食来避免胃疼一样荒唐。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "胃疼就好好治，那是胃疼的问题，不是要不要吃饭的问题。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "更关键的是——凡是为了“不被拿捏”而叫你“不要过多为别人考虑”的，都搞反了方向。", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你错了——恰恰是为你考虑，我不能让你欺负，拿捏、委屈我。", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "1）作为一个愿意提供服务、寻求双赢的人，如果我为这事纯消耗了、被欺负了、受委屈了，那么就是一个愿意为你服务的人纯消耗了、被欺负了，受委屈了，你就没法继续享受这么优良的服务了。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 425}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所以，为了你的长远利益考虑，有些条件我不能答应，我也不能受损，我更不能受欺负。", "char_start": 426, "char_end": 465}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我反抗、起诉，不是为了伤害你的利益，而是为了让我们的关系更有可持续性，不要变成一锤子买卖。", "char_start": 466, "char_end": 511}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "如果我拿到了赔偿款，损失得到了补偿，你我之间的信任得到了修复，那么我能提供的你还是可以继续得到，虽然不像你想要的那么理想，但也好过你什么帮助都得不到。", "char_start": 512, "char_end": 587}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "2）我如果放任你得逞，让你从这些行为里得到利益，你势必会变本加厉，得寸进尺。我隐忍一段的结果不光是我的利益受到更大损害，还会导致我的反击不得不加码，我不得不做到让你算完总账发现不值得，因为只有“总账亏损”才能遏制你的行为，而你这里盈利了一段，就会逼得我下次动手时加倍狠辣。", "char_start": 588, "char_end": 724}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "所以，恰恰是为了你着想，我不能忍气吞声。", "char_start": 725, "char_end": 745}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你看，谁说“为别人着想”就一定意味着软弱可欺、逆来顺受？", "char_start": 746, "char_end": 774}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "有人可能要说“你这是话说得漂亮，说来说去还是要顾自己”。", "char_start": 775, "char_end": 803}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "第一，我为什么就不能顾自己了？这有什么可疑问的吗？", "char_start": 804, "char_end": 829}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "第二，为了你好而实施的反制、惩戒和纯报复性、仇恨性的反制、惩戒是两回事。", "char_start": 830, "char_end": 866}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "后者是不考虑保留任何善意的做法，是一种寻求制造永久恐惧、迫使你永远消失、彻底丧失报复可能，甚至匍匐在地、甘愿称臣为奴的做法。而前者仅仅寻求停止错误的试探和投机，停止敌对行为。后者是猛烈、残酷、几乎没有底线的，而前者是理性、克制，随时可以通过妥协、协商解除的。", "char_start": 867, "char_end": 996}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这不是一个话说得漂亮的问题，而是的确恶意报复和关系建设之间有差别，而我确定是在进行关系建设。", "char_start": 997, "char_end": 1043}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "分寸固然要掌握，但你在思想上却从一开始就要做好准备——有过越界、有过摩擦、有过摩擦后的纠结、有过纠结后的释然与和好，这才是经过巩固和淬炼的关系。", "char_start": 1044, "char_end": 1116}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "反而是通过忍气吞声、低声下气“周全”出来的所谓的“交情”，其实是脆弱不堪的。", "char_start": 1117, "char_end": 1155}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你先立住了这个基本的信念，一开始就不要把“有异见、有冲突”视为一种瘟疫，恰恰相反，要把这视为“种牛痘”一样必经的洗礼。", "char_start": 1156, "char_end": 1215}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "我们现在如胶似漆，相交莫逆，但这不一定是我们最好的样子。", "char_start": 1216, "char_end": 1244}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "我们起了摩擦、生了误会，然后解决了摩擦、消除了误会之后会比现在更好。", "char_start": 1245, "char_end": 1279}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "我不能有意安排，但遇到了这事，我反而会有“淬火的时刻终于来了”的机遇感。", "char_start": 1280, "char_end": 1316}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "所谓患难见真情，不只有“天崩地裂我们要相依为命”这一种患难，“我们之间出了问题”也是一种患难。", "char_start": 1317, "char_end": 1364}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "甚至是更见真情的患难。", "char_start": 1365, "char_end": 1376}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "我会让你看到一个朋友反对你和一个敌人反对你有什么区别。", "char_start": 1377, "char_end": 1404}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "而且我希望在一切尘埃落定之后，我的应对会让你庆幸“幸亏这事是发生在我们之间，如果是发生在另外一个人和我之间，可能都没有这么和平的结果”。", "char_start": 1405, "char_end": 1473}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "既然我不曾回避，那么当一切落定之后，我眼里自然只有“我们曾经发生过摩擦和误会”这一种回忆，何来“被欺负、拿捏、受委屈”的抱怨可说呢？", "char_start": 1474, "char_end": 1540}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "爱不受辱，不是为了我自己而已，也是为了我们，为了你。", "char_start": 1541, "char_end": 1567}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 35}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0541"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么你越为别人考虑，越容易被欺负、拿捏、受委屈？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035"], "summary": "围绕“爱不受辱”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这都是些什么鬼扯淡？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这都是些什么鬼扯淡？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
